WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Priya: Route reads to the primary selectively. Start with payment confirmation on canary.
有选择地把读送到主库，先灰度支付确认。

2
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.360
Lukas: The capacity check passed at this rate. Keep admission limits for traffic spikes.
这个速率的容量检查通过，仍保留流量突增时的接纳限额。

3
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:19.943
Anika: Read-after-write consistency also needs cache bypass. Those endpoints won't serve cached states.
写后读一致性还需要绕过缓存，这些端点不再返回缓存状态。

4
00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:27.359
Hannah: Validate a new committed order first. Then expand customer status reads gradually.
先验证一笔新提交订单，再逐步扩展客户状态读取。

5
00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:34.175
Raj: Just to confirm, B stays a replica, right? No promotion changes in this incident.
确认一下，B仍是副本，对吧？这次不做提升切主。

6
00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:41.351
Lukas: Correct. Writer latency is our rollback trigger. Stop expansion if it gets worse.
对，写延迟是回退触发条件，变差就停止扩展。

7
00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:48.263
Priya: Okay, shed load from optional reports. Maybe defer them rather than overload primary.
好，减掉非必要报表负载，宁可延后也别压垮主库。

8
00:00:48.263 --> 00:00:56.254
Hannah: Don't send sensitive reads back blindly. If primary overloads, restrict that feature.
别盲目把敏感读送回副本，主库过载就限制该功能。

9
00:00:56.254 --> 00:01:01.846
Anika: I'm on it for the canary. I'll verify freshness and useful throughput.
我负责灰度，验证数据新鲜度和有效吞吐。

10
00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:08.710
Raj: So, I'll pause the next deletion. That reduces fresh WAL without stopping replication.
那我暂停下一批删除，减少新WAL但不停复制。

